It is a quiet Sunday morning in June.
I wake up late and lie in bed for a little bit.
The flat is very quiet today.
I get up and make myself a hot coffee.
This coffee smells really good.
Today, the normal shops are closed.
I have no appointments and do not have to run any errands.
I take my cup and look out the window.
The morning is bright, and the sun is shining.
This weather makes me very happy.
I think about my first time here in Berlin.
I arrived in Germany exactly five months ago.
Back then, it was January.
Five months ago, everything outside was dark and freezing cold.
And I didn't have a winter jacket!
Now I am drinking my coffee in the warm summer sun.
My life here has changed so much.
I have settled in well and am looking forward to this summer.
